physics: Cycle 891 checker -- calibrate the attack coverage gate and the
register-level comparison

First full run exited HONEST_FAIL on F_KRUN_ATTACK's own coverage threshold
(1337 cells against a declared 1500) with ZERO mismatches, and the register-level
comparison was reading the primary's SOURCE-only trace rows, which carry no bank
movement this checker records.  Attack trials raised to 4200; the register
comparison is now over the rows both instruments can see, is counted, and is
gated; the rule-text determinacy flag is computed rather than asserted.

